            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> expected to remove `<main>` which is on the same line of cursor\r\n\r\nAlthough, `<main>` is on the same line, `</main>` is further than 20 lines. If you don't want to restrict how far 'mini.surround' searches for the surrounding, set [`config.n_lines`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a3e19d7b7850e711485b8adde73ba44789f2cf6/doc/mini-surround.txt#L476-L477) to some big value (like 10000000).\r\n\r\nClosing as this works as expected.",
